{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalSubaccounts\">Capital subaccounts</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action And CapitalAccount CapitalSubaccounts Count On Port To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Capital subaccounts enable you to categorize transactions within each capital account for better tracking and reporting.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-list\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalSubaccounts\">Capital subaccounts</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action And Business CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Count Create Drawings FundsContributed Group Is On Profit ShareOfProfit To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">This feature allows you to group capital account transactions into categories such as <em>Drawings</em>, <em>Funds Contributed</em>, <em>Share of Profit</em>, and more. Subaccounts created here are available for all capital accounts in your business.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts ControlAccount Count From FromDate Is On Select Transaction Transactions\">When entering transactions in any capital control account, you will first select the capital account from the <strong>Capital Accounts</strong> tab, then choose one of the subaccounts defined on this screen.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And By CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts CapitalAccountsSummary Count On Port Reports Select Summary To ToDate View\">To view capital account movements organized by both accounts and subaccounts, go to the <strong>Reports</strong> tab and select <strong>Capital Accounts Summary</strong>.</p>",
  "key": "capital-subaccounts"
}
